   // Because of the overlapping greedy quantifiers and a deliberately failing suffix,
   // the engine enters an exponential backtracking loop. In this controlled environment
   // with the experimental flag `--regexp-backtracks-before-fallback=30000`, it will 
   // throw a RangeError once the limit is exceeded.
   return isSvg(maliciousInput);
